{"id":"CVE-2018-25046","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"Go","published":"2022-12-27T21:13:15.767Z","updated":"2025-04-11T22:53:21.678Z","title":"Path traversal in code.cloudfoundry.org/archiver","description":"Due to improper path sanitization, archives containing relative file paths can cause files to be written (or overwritten) outside of the target directory.","cwe":["CWE 29: Path Traversal: \"\\..\\filename\""],"metrics":[{"src":"CISA-ADP","v":"3.1","score":9.1,"sev":"CRITICAL","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:H"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"none","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"code.cloudfoundry.org/archiver","product":"code.cloudfoundry.org/archiver/extractor","packageName":"code.cloudfoundry.org/archiver/extractor","collectionURL":"https://pkg.go.dev","defaultStatus":"unaffected","versions":["affected 0 <0.0.0-20180523222229-09b5706aa936 (semver)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://github.com/cloudfoundry/archiver/commit/09b5706aa9367972c09144a450bb4523049ee840"},{"url":"https://snyk.io/research/zip-slip-vulnerability"},{"url":"https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2020-0025"}],"vendors":["golang"]}
{"id":"CVE-2018-1002207","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"snyk","published":"2018-07-25T17:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-09-16T23:35:55.371Z","description":"mholt/archiver golang package before e4ef56d48eb029648b0e895bb0b6a393ef0829c3 is vulnerable to directory traversal, allowing attackers to write to arbitrary files via a ../ (dot dot slash) in an archive entry that is mishandled during extraction. This vulnerability is also known as 'Zip-Slip'.","cwe":["CWE-22 CWE-22"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"golang","product":"archiver","versions":["affected unspecified <e4ef56d48eb029648b0e895bb0b6a393ef0829c3 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://snyk.io/research/zip-slip-vulnerability","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/snyk/zip-slip-vulnerability","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/mholt/archiver/pull/65","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://github.com/mholt/archiver/commit/e4ef56d48eb029648b0e895bb0b6a393ef0829c3","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://snyk.io/vuln/SNYK-GOLANG-GITHUBCOMMHOLTARCHIVERCMDARCHIVER-50071","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["golang"]}
